# jextract argument file: the C library's dynamic linker interface, <dlfcn.h>.
# Generates com.example.ffm.python.dlfcn (task jextractDlfcn). Nothing here is
# Python: LibPython uses dlopen to make an already-loaded libpython's symbols
# globally visible (see README, "Extension modules"). The functions resolve from
# the C library, through the linker's default lookup.

--include-function dlopen
--include-function dlerror
--include-constant RTLD_NOW
--include-constant RTLD_GLOBAL
--include-constant RTLD_NOLOAD
